  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Using Newton&nbsp;Leibnitz rule i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>v</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>u</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>dx</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>dx</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Using the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>331</mn><mn>360</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>331</mn><mn>360</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>330</mn><mn>360</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>331</mn><mn>360</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
